{"id":"wx2652899200","title":"全国多省市高校齐聚华农，研讨这件大事→","published_at":"2026-10-12T21:59:49+08:00","published_label":"2026-10-12","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBJs9uPJsaepWibLjNA14BF9F16tiaUTMyniciblmTGzvMGyXicTwJnGOAGfn79JOlibaD4mibwC7X4EJJ7pAcSKqROR8zbicxsJgKqLTY/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"10月12日，华南农业大学举行立德树人机制综合改革交流研讨会，助力改革工作向纵深推进。来自 北京、辽宁、上海、江苏、福建、江西、湖北、重庆、新疆 等13个省（区、市）18所高校及相关职能部门、院系党组织负责人近200人齐聚华农，以“聚力改革…","tags":["校园"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652899200&idx=1&sn=5a76b7eee3a9d1aa31356da081dd585b","paper_url":null,"word_count":1864,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:20:50+08:00","content_html":"<div><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlcib9OUORJLexR67iaNiaHMVsUPnrMCxOs4d75byZVqb9icp60drwxLtIDbs1v6NLBtGH2FfIrVwwNyQmw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAcGpORluPavfapuYWX99Lh1mibuiatHVV85gq4O7SwxgEaauJ28m3Y8q1tysGmd7gQpWgBic0DFniaR1Ich8Tv06BULWxQRt1LM20/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>10月12日，华南农业大学举行立德树人机制综合改革交流研讨会，助力改革工作向纵深推进。来自</span></span><span><span>北京、辽宁、上海、江苏、福建、江西、湖北、重庆、新疆</span></span><span><span>等13个省（区、市）18所高校及相关职能部门、院系党组织负责人近200人齐聚华农，以“聚力改革攻坚 共探提质路径”为主题展开交流互鉴。华农党委书记李凤亮出席会议并致辞，副校长陈乐天主持会议。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckDPTPE8kyr3fyK9znvqUvibPl3Ov8OhcSCJGVymqibTNJBXLoncXXGUpg7W75ch2pGFcaZjnlLoveGmJyqSzVC5iaFiczp5dpBHfm0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>会议现场</span></span></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckBEcm3ibVHTUUicHjwAiaawEsjo2AkLBAI4mPpgicSiargNsh0Srve7Lerq3E9OZ4wictoYiaZvSicJYHuBTUXhwAW1GpOw1qKHh56pNzM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>华农党委书记李凤亮致辞</span></span></section><p><span><span>“邀请大家跨越山海到华农来，不仅仅为了办好一个会，更是希望在全国试点高校之间搭建一座联通东西、贯穿南北的育人经验交流之桥，打开一扇互学互鉴、携手共进的协同创新之窗，织密一张资源共享、难题共解的立德树人合作之网。”围绕本次交流中的新经验、新做法、新气象，李凤亮分享了三点意见。</span></span></p><p><span><span>一是乘势拓新，在识变应变中开新局，彰显立德树人新价值。</span><span>教育部启动立德树人机制综合改革试点工作，标志着高校思想政治工作正在经历一场从“单点突破”走向“系统重塑”的深刻转型，各高校要从全局和战略的高度深刻把握其时代逻辑。</span></span></p><p><span><span>二是守正日新，在坚守初心中铸新魂，打造思政育人新范式。</span><span>要更加注重创新突破、系统集成、成果转化，强化顶层设计、资源整合、品牌塑造、数智赋能和文化引领。</span></span></p><p><span><span>三是协同创新，在同向同行中蹚新路，汇聚时代育人新合力。</span><span>华农期待以本次交流研讨会为契机，进一步加强与兄弟院校的常态化联系，在互学互鉴中共同提升，在协同攻关中共同破题，携手谱写新时代立德树人崭新篇章。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCQRIxSEEWBGmNNkxRmX6qfvEeicjuRMn5h8WvvNbVliaLpeYrC9ziahedmULHCHLykqwX8ZPjQhGJ6sIMDlcPfp2j7WicfhqLtpdM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><span>主论坛交流发言</span></span></section><p><span><span>实施新时代立德树人工程是建设教育强国的“一号工程”，也是高校必须扛起的政治责任，改革越往深处走，越需要开门问策、集思广益。本次交流研讨会采取“主论坛+分论坛”形式进行对话交流，既有顶层设计上的思考，也有破解难点堵点的实招，带来一场思想盛会。</span></span></p><p><span><span>其中，主论坛立足全局，重点研讨改革顶层设计、体系重构与成果培育。红满堂里，全国试点高校及有关兄弟院校代表依次上台，围绕立德树人工作创新举措、难点问题与工作经验进行交流。北京工业大学党委副书记张辉、东北大学党委副书记张玉宝、苏州大学党委副书记邓敏、闽江大学党委副书记任涛、</span></span><span><span>南昌大学副校长陈始发、</span></span><span><span>塔里木大学副校长张宏荣、深圳职业技术大学党委副书记何莉等先后发言，介绍了各校改革工作的总体思路与推进成效。中国农业大学、华中科技大学、中南大学、中山大学等高校职能部门负责人、试点院系代表，则立足一线实践分享了基层推进工作的具体探索与思考。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“从华农实践看，传承校本根脉是培育红色新农人的立魂之本，强化机制创新是深化文化育人的长效之要，激活教师内生动力是凝聚全员力量的破局之道。”陈乐天介绍，自去年6月获批教育部立德树人机制综合改革试点高校以来，华农制定了以“固本铸魂，育英强农”为主题的三年行动方案，提出了“固本铸魂、场域浸润、协同融通、精准提升”四大计划，同步开展十大行动，系统部署20项重点任务、162条具体举措，全覆盖二级学院推进15项试点任务。</span></span></p><section><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckCzzuufyqDU0FH3D3GnqdYeZHDyYubgHdJtMBmj1rqLsXSJhwibN3GuVtXiaicJUER0r7Qpial5Zva5nTXRkFfic8JiaF9d0CaicZpZnw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></section><section><span><span>分论坛讨论</span></span></section><p><span><span>学院会议室里，三个平行分论坛紧扣“铸魂领航、场域融通、协同赋能”专题，部分参会试点高校职能部门、院系负责人，与华农学生工作一线职能部门及学院代表展开面对面交流，从党建引领、机制创新、家校协同等角度讨论改革思路和举措成效。</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAkbp4BhkC2ibUBT6P1o85rvj7qIE1d6jn2sY7trZ2SAXPPYBQFf2MYuv5TwNXDibflqacra4wpMFiatYU2G2iaBX4b6khnPdgXno0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>为华农辅导员育人工作“十佳案例”颁发证书</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckB0MdDRD6Zqk1JfZ4Jian3tPNWk9TTgTMw1b9VXoic20UECqs0jIunOXG3tpazicSNE4SxHmCDoic7eiab3jhKLVK8MO4tZ3QVe9ZEc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>参观卢永根先进事迹陈列展</span></span></p><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/dVw6Fiav4ckAHY9T9QorSJGhfXwRexeVhUbTdScqlKc53p1Z5R0zlotVbr0pDJHNT9QMI2KMUOJrQDxO7HktEcaNG3ZS5DYEfycTgQtVktoE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><span>参观“一站式”学生社区育人平台</span></span></p><p><span><span>会议为华农辅导员育人工作“十佳案例”颁发证书。与会嘉宾还参观了卢永根院士先进事迹展、“一站式”学生社区育人平台，实地体验华农校园文化精品路线。</span></span></p><p><span><span>“立德树人是高校的根本任务，也是我们共同的时代答卷。”会后，与会代表表示，愿以此次研讨会为契机，进一步加强校际交流合作，携手并肩、同向同行，共同探索立德树人机制综合改革的新路径、新经验、新模式，努力为教育强国建设贡献更多高校智慧和力量。</span></span></p><p><span><span>立德树人机制综合改革任重道远</span></span></p><p><span><span>华农愿做学习者、探路者、同行者</span></span></p><p><span><span>与各位同</span></span><span><span>侪</span></span><span><span>携手</span></span></p><p><span><span>谱写</span></span><span><span>新时代立德树人崭新篇章</span></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><b><span>往期回顾</span></b></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652826032&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=9cd1b623907b438d08d52864c0906589&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBKLcuWQjcicENkqLXQoU3yY9YFXQ7Wib3sZR5IWHrpV7OY9goTsJt6r8Ju8oOfibOrUbWXbWdUiarxr3Ficxg6UGAdAEsb6Pu6XHvA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/ </span></strong></span><span>教育部部长怀进鹏在华南农业大学主持召开高质量启动实施新时代立德树人工程调研座谈会</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652898784&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=25b61303164ad83096763fe69143d81c&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckBK3geHC55Z6vsGtW80ePP11RCcsLic1kpeKKL8fZDg8xWO9HynCa9I9tusHsfdLWtoic2jibpf1kLMp88oTD09pHt9zUIiaicjpDcQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span><span>教育部思政司来华农调研立德树人机制综合改革试点工作</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652896488&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=3ced6968bbbbaa786d34df2fef901c70&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDib0a9B9RONhxp9GD9H8xW9CqAhjnoXhKXEE3rPoDlFEZhD0QgxG6yFaiaHeCxpSCzycDRr7XB2r1UN80499Ht0CxoZJetBzJrI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span><span>这群学农的年轻人，为什么被人民日报、新华社同时点赞？</span><span><strong><span>/</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckARHTVM8hLt7JbrQwEMgswWrKuXzmW0XOUv80k5iaYPVz6ibXSEoOccicYAhpY87KAicSK8lpNoJcvIGYGbtwy1Cd252M94YWicItFk/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>-SCAU-</span></p></section><section><p><span>文丨费思迎</span></p><p><span>图丨林慷祺 新禾融媒体工作室 吴晓琳 钟鸣烨</span></p><p><span>党委学生工作部（党委研究生工作部）</span></p><p><span>学工融媒体中心</span><span>（易班学生工作站）</span><span> 骆锦航</span></p><p><span>初审丨费思迎</span></p><p><span>复审丨陈芃辰</span></p><p><span>终审丨胡东生</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>“</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckDR3XmF9ytjuc2BXTF2kh7I4jlQjL4ceW1vqvUdcCHq1WGictRxNj8BOEbTTnTeMINSX3WfYUd9BF0ibEVJNDM6qYW9Roht4JWxI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>”</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>扫码关注华农官微，获取最新资讯</span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/dVw6Fiav4ckAzQ63nJIMiahaDqZRhbVpdSb39xvIhU58fIpicZia0bRzwg7LiaSEUzKHS4gtMNa8iclIQvdHhiaqCqXrCOiaib7wrMWncRKIyG9u98eM/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>点赞</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckDIoKklQEV24zibQU8cBhbHMxEb0Q8M5bycxx9aLIEV8PX2CfoRGpibia9M80uogVoZml0vHiceg6Jk05vLA3jB4vKpOIQrqHEFJlw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>分享</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckAg2E0LERjv6oFOvcBqPQ3rCz5tzp6ORN2Ht5jvOOhA4RmtcTPQ9BHPu2YooFt2mkSQFhObHKibzDiaLMMyjWBsBolhT5zLLCrYI/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><b><span>推荐</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/dVw6Fiav4ckCF1BvaKoXWKj0MVxg6IMdxAo1QEJEJGiaNzJWNNOMSdiabiceYYyiaxwAs3y1WdFlmpYdo9KSGoA4QytxptcfNSwia57nACxUjX9QA/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></div>"}
